**APPROVED** = all topics in this cycle meet all quality criteria.
**REQUEST_MORE** = one or more topics fail. List exactly what's missing.

> **Note**: The loop does NOT automatically re-run research on REQUEST_MORE. The researcher
> has already written the files. The synthesizer will see your REQUEST_MORE verdict and
> compensate by noting gaps in the output docs. Use REQUEST_MORE only for genuine quality
> failures, not minor style issues.

